sequenceDiagram
    participant Cron as Cron Scheduler
    participant FreshPolling as pollingRefreshNewsFeeds
    participant FetchFeedItems as fetchFeedItems
    participant PushPolling as pollingPushNewsFeeds
    participant CleanupPolling as pollingCleanupPushHistory
    participant DB as Supabase Database
    participant RSS as RSS Feed Sources
    participant TradingView as TradingView API
    participant Bot as Telegram Bot API
    participant Subscriber as Telegram Subscribers

    Note over Cron,FreshPolling: 每 60 秒執行一次
    Cron->>FreshPolling: Trigger (*/60 * * * * *)
    FreshPolling->>DB: SELECT id, feed_type, feed_url, feed_config, enabled<br/>FROM tg_rss_feeds WHERE enabled=true
    DB-->>FreshPolling: Return feeds list

    loop For each feed (Promise.all with try-catch)
        FreshPolling->>FetchFeedItems: fetchFeedItems(feed)

        alt feed_type === 'rss'
            FetchFeedItems->>RSS: Fetch & parse RSS XML
            RSS-->>FetchFeedItems: Return FeedItem[]
        else feed_type === 'tradingview'
            FetchFeedItems->>TradingView: Fetch & transform JSON API
            TradingView-->>FetchFeedItems: Return FeedItem[]
        else Unknown or error
            FetchFeedItems-->>FreshPolling: Return []
        end

        FetchFeedItems-->>FreshPolling: Return FeedItem[] with feed_id
    end

    FreshPolling->>FreshPolling: Flatten, validate & convert timezone
    FreshPolling->>DB: UPSERT tg_rss_items (onConflict: title)
    DB-->>FreshPolling: Return count or error

    Note over Cron,PushPolling: 每 2 分鐘執行一次
    Cron->>PushPolling: Trigger (*/2 * * * *)
    PushPolling->>DB: SELECT items with feeds (last 1h, enabled, LIMIT 100)
    DB-->>PushPolling: Return items
    PushPolling->>DB: SELECT watchers JOIN observers
    DB-->>PushPolling: Return subscribers
    PushPolling->>DB: SELECT push_history
    DB-->>PushPolling: Return history

    PushPolling->>PushPolling: Build tasks (filter by history & retry logic)

    alt No items / subscribers / tasks
        PushPolling->>PushPolling: Exit early
    end

    loop For each task
        PushPolling->>Bot: sendMessage(tg_id, formatted_message)
        Bot->>Subscriber: Push notification
        Bot-->>PushPolling: Result

        alt Success
            PushPolling->>DB: INSERT history (success, retry=0) + Wait 500ms
        else Permanent error (400/403/404)
            PushPolling->>DB: INSERT history (failed, retry=999)
        else Temporary error
            PushPolling->>DB: INSERT history (failed, retry=1)
        end
    end

    Note over Cron,CleanupPolling: 每 60 分鐘執行一次
    Cron->>CleanupPolling: Trigger (*/60 * * * *)
    CleanupPolling->>DB: DELETE push_history WHERE pushed_at < cutoff
    DB-->>CleanupPolling: Return count/error
    CleanupPolling->>DB: DELETE rss_items WHERE pub_date < cutoff AND created_at < cutoff
    DB-->>CleanupPolling: Return count/error